==History==
2016
*The Fireball [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016.
*On 19/2/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (19/2/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the Fireball’s [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Tower]] damage to 40% of the full damage (from 50%).
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], changed the Fireball's card image.
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], increased the {{Rarity|Rare}} card Level cap to 11 (from 10).
2017
*On 12/12/2017, the [[Version History#Electrifying Update (12/12/2017)|Electrifying Update]], decreased the Fireball’s Crown Tower damage to 35% of the full damage (from 40%).
2018
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Update%20(25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]], allowed the Fireball to be placed on the river.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Rare}} cards start at Level 3 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 11).
*On 1/10/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (1/10/2018)|Balance Update]], fixed a bug where [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] that were spawned after their parent troops died would be immune to [[:Category:Spell Cards|spell]] damage.
2020
*On 4/8/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/8/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Fireball’s Crown Tower damage to 30% of the full damage (from 35%).
2021
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 2/8/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(2/8/2022)|Balance Update]], decreased the Fireball's pushback range to 1 tile (from 1.8 tiles).
2023
*On 27/3/2023, the [[Version History#Losers%20Update%20(27/3/2023)|Losers Update]], increased the Fireball's reflect radius to 0.7 tiles (from 0.6 tiles).
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Fireball's damage by 0.14%.
*2026
*1/7/26 Decreased the fireballs crown tower damage by 17% 207-172 [https://supercell.com/en/games/clashroyale/blog/release-notes/june-balance-changes-2026/ june update]
2026

* On 1/6/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Fireball’s Crown Tower damage to 25% of its full damage (from 30%)

