==Trivia==
*While not available as a spell in Clash of Clans, the Fireball reappears there as [https://clashofclans.fandom.com/wiki/Fireball a hero equipment for the Grand Warden].
*The Fireball is 1 of 7 [[cards]] that is already unlocked for the player when they start playing the game, the others being the [[Minions]], [[Archers]], [[Knight]], [[Arrows]], [[Tower Princess]], and [[Giant]]. Despite this, the game recognizes that those cards are unlocked in the [[Training Camp]].
*The Fireball is one of the first [[:Category:Spell Cards|spell]] cards to be featured in a [[Training Camp|Trainer]]'s [[Battle Decks|deck]], alongside the Arrows, [[Zap]], and [[Rocket]].
*The Fireball is one of the first spells to be featured in a [[Loading Screens|Loading Screen]], alongside the Arrows and Rocket.
*The first part of Fireball's description is a reference to the Clash of Clans [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6BsTLlR40kM Magic commercial].
*Although not available as a spell, the Fireball reappears as [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/Wizard Wizard]'s active ability in [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/Squad_Busters_Wiki Squad Busters].
**In Clash Royale, it is simply called "Fireball", but in Squad Busters, it is called "Mega Fireball".
*The Fireball was featured in the winning decks of multiple Clash Royale Tournaments. More specifically:
**The Fireball was featured in the winning deck of the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kIGdeKaT_is The Crown Duel Tournament], by a player called Backstabx.
**The Fireball was featured in the winning deck of the [https://www.youtube.com/live/C5qBcdcErfM?si=e37mhAgNKAA5kMJI Clash Royale League 2018 Tournament], by a player called Lciop.
**The Fireball was featured in the winning deck of the [https://www.youtube.com/live/h3IOFTfT8Sk?si=wTF1FekCifpSULn- Clash Royale League 2020 Tournament], by a player called Ruben.
